#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/architecture.md:1
#: 37fb4dfb42724502bc4e3bf0ac8b4deb
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "Architecture"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/architecture.md:3
#: bf47c05fdf74429485a451c1b01b9fa2
msgid ""
"A narrow Python gateway converts reviewed client requests into typed "
"simulator and audit operations."
msgstr ""
"Une passerelle Python etroite convertit les requetes client revisees en "
"operations typees de simulation et d'audit."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/architecture.md:5
#: 2b939b1a57174aa0a711bbc8b0a4d038
msgid ""
"It also owns the `securedme.education.auth-enforcer.v1` audit boundary. All "
"twelve catalog repositories carry Codex and Antigravity "
"`securedme.education.webauth-template.v1` adapters. The Gateway validates "
"policy shape and secret exclusions; it does not impersonate an identity "
"provider or absorb application sessions."
msgstr ""
"It also owns the `securedme.education.auth-enforcer.v1` audit boundary. All "
"twelve catalog repositories carry Codex and Antigravity "
"`securedme.education.webauth-template.v1` adapters. The Gateway validates "
"policy shape and secret exclusions; it does not impersonate an identity "
"provider or absorb application sessions."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/architecture.md:7
#: 53017e76f6954d41b2a2e220cfaa0d6f
msgid "Data flow"
msgstr "Flux de donnees"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/architecture.md:18
#: e15ee4a3de9a4c3f9fa1a2c8cd6a027b
msgid ""
"Adapter presence is not runtime proof. A product may claim live login only "
"after its provider callback, account binding, expiry, logout, recovery, and "
"accessibility paths pass in that product's deployed environment."
msgstr ""
"Adapter presence is not runtime proof. A product may claim live login only "
"after its provider callback, account binding, expiry, logout, recovery, and "
"accessibility paths pass in that product's deployed environment."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/architecture.md:20
#: 282765739cba4690adc32faf3aa18b43
msgid "Provenance"
msgstr "Provenance"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/architecture.md:22
#: 2aef07d7d58e4fc0bb26b228ee903722
msgid ""
"Record the repository commit, configuration, input identifiers, execution "
"command, output location, and validation result. A screenshot alone is not a"
" reproducible artifact."
msgstr ""
"Consignez le commit du depot, la configuration, les identifiants d'entree, "
"la commande d'execution, l'emplacement de sortie et le resultat de "
"validation. Une capture seule n'est pas un artefact reproductible."

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/architecture.md:24
#: 9e19b3a84e70477d86af1d64d98592b2
msgid "Failure behavior"
msgstr "Comportement en cas d'echec"

#: ../../docs/tools/fnpqnn-gateway/architecture.md:26
#: b95eb91c9bda4011a778fc59a1299bfb
msgid ""
"Missing configuration, unavailable dependencies, invalid input, and failed "
"tests must remain visible. The tool must not replace a failure with invented"
" success."
msgstr ""
"Une configuration absente, des dependances indisponibles, une entree "
"invalide et des tests echoues doivent rester visibles. L'outil ne doit pas "
"remplacer un echec par un succes invente."
